1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,240
In a single drop of water... a whole world is fighting to
survive.

2
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:14,190
This is Microverse. Guide a living colony through a
changing microscopic world.

3
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:23,520
Drag through three or more blue cells. Close the loop
around green food, then release. Your cells merge, absorb,
and return.

4
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:31,020
Poison in your path? Nudge it aside. Make a clean meal.

5
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:40,220
But the water is alive with hungry rivals. Protect Mother
before they reach her heart.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,830
Catch the hunter. Rescue a fragile life.

7
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:56,140
Spend what you gather to evolve. New abilities. New
anatomy. Your colony, transformed.

8
00:00:56,650 --> 00:01:05,010
Cross three living waters. Changing encounters. Different
colors. A new journey every time.

9
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:13,110
Discover rare creatures... and bring the lives you save
home.

10
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:19,230
Then face the giants. Learn their rhythm. Find your
moment.

11
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:29,440
Microverse. Feed. Protect. Evolve.
